An UrlArtifact EP object’s structure differs in two ways from the general
form of the EpObject : Its ObjectTypeProperty will be set to the appropriate EPOBJ_T value ( "<number:EPOBJ_T:UrlArtifact>" ). A single additional property appears in both the Create and Fetch forms of
the EP object’s data block: "Url": "<string>" .
